      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-325715",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/04/04e343ace6babe91a6ec974dc9392f56338fab4986724f5eb4ce13aa9777f7b9.png)\n\nIn a large public school, $34$ students were surveyed about their weekend habits. For each student, the average time spent doing homework on Saturdays ($x$, in hours) and the average time spent streaming shows on Saturdays ($y$, in hours) were recorded to the nearest half hour. The scatter plot above shows the data with a line of best fit.\n\nThe line of best fit **underestimates** one student\u2019s reported streaming time by more than $1.5$ hours. For how many hours did this student report doing homework on Saturdays?"
